    "official": "Myrtle is a\nDurin\n. She has insisted that her previous job title be recorded as: Generalissimo.\nHer appearance and temperament are somewhat childish, but on the battlefield, she displays considerable enthusiasm and knack for command. She is able to boost\noperator\nmorale while at the same time, providing them treatment. She is totally reliable.",
